<title>USA: Scotts buys remaining Miracle Garden stake.</title>
<headline>Scotts buys remaining Miracle Garden stake.</headline>
<dateline>MARYSVILLE, OHIO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotts Co said it signed a letter of intent to buy the remaining 67.6 percent interest in Britain's Miracle Garden Care Ltd that it does not own for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>The acquisition, expected to be completed in January, will have &quot;netural to slightly accretive earnings implications for Scotts in 1997,&quot;  the company said in a statement. The company provided no further details and could not be immediately reached to comment.</p>
<p>The acquisition will help the company expand in Europe's lawn care and garden products market, Scotts said.</p>
</text>
